  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "README"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Autumn Components is a Nuxt 3 application for building, previewing, and documenting reusable page blocks. It is governed by the Autumn Components Constitution, which defines standards for architecture, design system integration, configuration, developer experience, and workflow."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Core Principles"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Component-First Architecture**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Every feature starts as a reusable Vue component in `app/components/blocks/[ComponentName]/`"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Components are self-contained, independently testable, and documented with fixtures"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No organizational-only components; clear purpose required"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Standardized structure: `Component.vue`, `form.yaml`, `fixture.ts`, `theme.ts`"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Design System Integration**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Token-driven design system (Style Dictionary → CSS variables)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Live token editing with localStorage persistence"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tailwind-variants for theme composition"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Visual color swatches and accessibility checks"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Form-Driven Configuration**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "YAML form schemas for component configuration"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Conditional field visibility (`when` conditions)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Repeater fields with drag-and-drop reordering"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Flat-to-nested prop mapping for complex data"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Local persistence of form state and repeater order"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Live Preview & Testing**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Device frame simulation: Laptop/Tablet/Phone"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Real-time prop updates and instant visual feedback"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Design token changes apply instantly"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Skeleton loaders for loading states"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Developer Experience**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Comprehensive documentation and examples for each component"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Block registry auto-discovers components"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Storybook-like viewer at `/blocks` for exploration"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hot reloading for rapid iteration"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "TypeScript throughout for type safety"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Technology Stack"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Frontend**: Nuxt 3, Vue 3 Composition API"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**UI**: Nuxt UI, Tailwind CSS"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**State**: Vue refs, localStorage"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Build**: Vite, TypeScript"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Design Tokens**: Style Dictionary"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Theming**: tailwind-variants"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Icons**: Iconify (Lucide, Simple Icons)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Linting**: ESLint (Nuxt config)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Type Checking**: TypeScript strict mode"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Package Manager**: pnpm"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Version Control**: Git (conventional commits)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Component Creation Workflow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Create component directory in `app/components/blocks/[ComponentName]/`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Implement `[ComponentName].vue` with TypeScript"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Define `form.yaml` schema for configuration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Create `fixture.ts` with sample data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Implement `theme.ts` with tailwind-variants"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. Test in block viewer at `/blocks/[component-slug]`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Quality Gates"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "All components must pass TypeScript compilation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ESLint must pass without errors"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-59",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Components must render correctly in all device preview modes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-60",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Form schemas must validate without errors"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Design tokens must apply correctly to components"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Review Process"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-64",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "All PRs must include component documentation updates"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-65",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "New components must be tested in block viewer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-66",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Design token changes validated across all components"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-67",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Performance impact assessed for new features"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Governance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Constitution supersedes all other practices. Amendments require documentation, approval, and migration plan. All PRs/reviews must verify compliance. Complexity must be justified with clear use cases. Use component documentation for runtime development guidance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
